---
description: Schema changes only through dbmate migrations
globs: "backend/migrations/**/*.sql"
alwaysApply: false
---

# dbmate

- One new timestamped SQL file per change. Never edit a migration that has been applied.
- Include `-- migrate:up` and `-- migrate:down`. Down is required and must be real.
- Composite FKs `(workspace_id, id)`, `FORCE ROW LEVEL SECURITY` on tenant tables.
- Roles: `outreach` owns tables (migrations only); `outreach_app` is what api/worker use.
- Do not put DDL in Go, sqlc, or app startup.
